WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.845
Open a client lists your clients with an Open link that signs you

00:00:06.845 --> 00:00:08.287
in without a password.

00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:11.582
Click the star next to a client to make it a favorite, and

00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:15.290
favorites, with the clients you opened recently, are listed first.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.055
Sign out of every client ends every session you have open in your

00:00:20.055 --> 00:00:21.939
clients, on every device.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:26.800
Use it when you leave a shared computer, or when someone leaves your team.

